// The words BugReportChatCensor masks in the chat lines of a bug report, held as
// salted hashes so the list itself is not in the repository in clear text. It
// covers racial, ethnic, religious, homophobic, transphobic and ableist slurs and
// the strongest sexual profanity, each with its -s and -z plurals. Ordinary
// swearing is deliberately not here.
//
