// o i e a s t a s i; everything but a-z dropped; a run of three or more of one
// letter cut to two), hash it with BugReportChatCensor.Hash(normalised, false),
// and add the value here. Add Hash(Normalise(word, collapseAll: true), true) as
// well: that form, every run cut to one letter, is what a stretched spelling is
